(
    title: "Frogs and Flies",
    developer: Some("Peter Kaminski, Tom Soulanille"),
    description: Some("Two frogs face off across a pond, each leaping between lily pads and flicking out its tongue to snatch the flies buzzing past — the tongue only connects when the frog is lined up just ahead of or behind a bug, so timing is everything. As the sky darkens from day to dusk over the round, whichever frog has swallowed the most flies by nightfall wins."),
